---
// PropositionSection.astro
---

<section class="bg-gray-50 py-12 px-6">
  <div class="container mx-auto text-center">
    <!-- Title -->
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-8">
      企业面临双碳和 ESG 的政策压力，存在「披露合规」和「价值创造」两个根本痛点
    </h2>
    <!-- Content -->
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-center gap-6">
      <!-- Left Card -->
      <div
        class="flex-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-100 to-blue-50 rounded-[50px] p-8 flex flex-col items-center shadow-md"
      >
        <ul class="text-left text-gray-700 space-y-4 mb-6">
          <li>双碳/ESG披露要求<b>快速增多</b>，监管增强，企业压力大</li>
          <li>链主、外贸设有<b>绿色门槛</b>，企业需满足诸多认证规范</li>
          <li>然而，企业<b>缺乏专业经验和配套工具</b>，只能大量投入人力做合规，带来额外的成本</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="w-32 h-32 flex items-center justify-center bg-blue-500 text-white rounded-full shadow-lg">
          <span class="text-md font-bold mt-2">披露合规</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Card -->
      <div
        class="flex-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-green-100 to-white rounded-[50px] p-8 flex flex-col items-center shadow-md"
      >
        <ul class="text-left text-gray-700 space-y-4 mb-6">
          <li>双碳建设<b>需要成本</b>，企业需要资金和动力</li>
          <li>企业同时希望创造<b>额外收入</b></li>
          <li>然而，企业<b>缺乏专业经验和配套工具</b>，难以实现相关绿色价值</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="w-32 h-32 flex items-center justify-center bg-green-500 text-white rounded-full shadow-lg">
          <span class="text-md font-bold mt-2">价值创造</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
